ONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조310; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조310\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조310\">노력봉사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조310; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조310\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조310\">문화교류 등의 다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조310\">양한 체험활동을 펼치게 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2018</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조310; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조310\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조310\">꿈과 사람속으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조310; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조310\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACIN